      "a": "The federal government awarded $9.6B through SDVOSB set-asides in FY2026 to date. The program generated 15,273 awards at an average award size of $627K. Obligations were up 10.1% year over year. Fiscal history shows totals of $7.2B in FY21, $8B in FY22, $9.1B in FY23, $8.8B in FY24, and $8.7B in FY25."
